# MAQAM Ecosystem — AI Coding Agent Master Guide (`guide.md`)

This file serves as the **absolute, binding blueprint** for all code generation, UI components, architectural patterns, and business logic within the **MAQAM** project (`maqam-eg.com`). Any AI agent or developer contributing to this repository MUST strictly comply with the guidelines defined herein.

---

## 1. Brand Identity & Core Metadata
* **Brand Name:** MAQAM (always Latin — never translate to «مقام» in UI/chrome)
* **Official Domain:** `maqam-eg.com`
* **Support Email:** `support@maqam-eg.com`
* **Tagline:** Prestige in Every Touch / الفخامة في كل لمسة
* **Primary Typography:** `Alexandria` (Google Font) must be used across all web, mobile, and dashboard interfaces for both Arabic and English text.

---

## 2. Design System & Color Palette

### A. Light Mode UI (Dashboard & Web Store Standard)
Inspired by clean bento-grid layouts and professional enterprise interfaces, light mode must use the following exact surface and accent tokens:
* **Background / Main Surface:** `#F7F6F2` (Soft Warm Ivory)
* **Card / Container Background:** `#ECEAE4` (Pearl Gray / Soft Ivory Container)
* **Primary Accent (Buttons, Active States, Key Metrics):** `#C5A059` (Deep Architectural Gold)
* **Secondary Gold Tones (Gradients / Patterns):** `#dcb479` and `#a98e48`
* **Primary Typography (Headings & Body):** `#0B0F19` (Deep Charcoal for maximum contrast)
* **Secondary / Muted Text:** `#5F6368`

### B. Dark Mode & Brand Core
* **Core Dark Navy Background:** `#161b29`
* **Gold Highlights:** `#dcb479` / `#a98e48`

---

## 3. UI / UX Layout & Architecture Guidelines

### Dashboard Layout (`Admin Dashboard - Laravel / Tailwind`)
* **Bento-Grid Structure:** Dashboard pages must use modular, rounded card containers (`#ECEAE4` on `#F7F6F2` in light mode) with clean padding, subtle shadows, and clear visual hierarchy.
* **Sidebar Navigation:** Fixed left sidebar divided into clear logical sections (`MENU`, `GENERAL`) featuring intuitive icons, active pill indicators, and quick action widgets (e.g., Mobile App download prompt card).
* **Data Visualization:** Use clean status pills, circular progress indicators, and minimalist bar/line analytics charts matching the architectural gold and dark charcoal color palette.
* **Simplicity & Professionalism:** Avoid clutter. Maintain consistent spacing, high contrast, and a polished, enterprise-grade finish ("Simple and Professional").

### QR Print Spec (Prize Category Background)
* Each `categories_prize` row MUST store a HEX `background_color`.
* Generated QR PNGs for a batch MUST fill the full image canvas with that category color, then render the QR code centered on top (with a small white quiet zone behind the QR modules for scan reliability).
* Example: Prize Category 1 → green `#22C55E` → every exported PNG for that category has a green background.
* Batch export: up to 5,000 PNGs zipped for print vendors.

---

## 4. Product Scope Reminders
1. **Core engines:** WhatsApp OTP auth, unified cart (Redis), Paymob + COD + wallet, QR scanning with offline SQLite caching, AI chatbot, and anti-fraud engines.
2. **Localization:** Full dynamic support for Arabic (`ar`) and English (`en`) across all UI strings, notifications, and database records.
3. **Admin Dashboard:** Full management of users, merchants, ranks, prize/store categories, products, orders, coupons, wheel, notifications, settings, and QR batch generation with colored PNG export.
